      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُدَاخِلٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُخْلُلٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاقَةٌ مُدَاخِلَةٌ الخَلْقِ</span> <i>A
she-camel compact, and firm,</i> or <i>strong, in make.</i>
(TA.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الجِسْمِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ مُتَداخِلُ</span></b>  (K, * TA) <i>A
man compact,</i> or <i>contracted, in body;</i> lit., <i>having
one portion thereof inserted into another.</i> (TA.)

